include CHANGELOG.md COMPATIBILITY.md CONTRIBUTING.md RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md SECURITY.md
graft docs
graft examples
graft tests
recursive-include .github/scripts *.py
recursive-include .github/workflows *.yml
prune assets
prune data
global-exclude .env .env.* *.pem *.key *.so *.py[cod]
include .env.example
